    {
      "id": "p0154-b017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "\"Is your refrigerator running?\" is a classic telephone prank in some English speaking regions. The prank follows this pattern:",
        "raw": "\"Is your refrigerator running?\" is a classic telephone prank in some English\nspeaking regions. The prank follows this pattern:",
