      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "In his translation notes, Toby explains that the joke in this scene is an anti-joke: it has no point, there's no punchline, and Sans just takes everything literally.",
        "raw": "In his translation notes, Toby explains that the joke in this scene is an anti-joke:\nit has no point, there's no punchline, and Sans just takes everything literally.",
        "status": "corrected",
